      "@type": "Attestation",
      "schema:name": "The study mentions that British, Venetian, Genoese, Dutch, and French commercial ships operating from Ottoman ports in the second half of the 17th century were attacked by pirates before Algeria, Tunisia, and Tripoli.",
      "properties": {
